      "char_end": 1184,
      "text": "Health OATLY SWEDISH AND INTERDEPENDENT SINCE 1994 We're the world's first oat drink company, here to make it easy for people to eat better and live healthier lives without recklessly taxing the planet's resources in the process. We've been saying the above line for years, which makes sense since it's our mission statement. Born in Sweden and operating globally, we started with our original unflavoured and fortified oat drink, for humans seeking to replace products processed from cows in their cooking, baking, coffee, drinks, smoothies, or whatever, without compromising on taste or nutritional value. Since then, we’ve gone on to make all kinds of amazing products.",
